# Git LFS — the DEV bulk CSV corpus (seeds-to-tracked-csv-migration D38).
#
# data/db-export-bulk/ holds the exported DEV bulk half — the DEV-only tables
# statements (~5.24M rows), referenced_vars (~10.88M), call_edges (~1.29M) +
# the kcdx_id-NULL bulk address_versions discovery rows. These are tracked (the
# rebuild genesis + the history) but are far too large to live in the git object
# store as diffable text, so they ride Git LFS. The CURATED export
# (data/db-export/*.csv, ~157 rows) stays PLAIN git text — it is the small,
# human-reviewable diff layer (D1/D20); only the bulk is LFS.
data/db-export-bulk/*.csv filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
